    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1402">

                <pb facs="1242" n="984" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg984"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 867.4016/74</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The</hi>
                    
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State</hi>
                    
                    <hi rendition="#italic">to the Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Morgenthau</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-16T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 16, 1915, 4 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>865. Your 841, July 10. Department approves your procedure in pleading with
                    Turkish Minister of Interior and Minister of War to stop Armenian persecution
                    and in attempting to enlist sympathies of German and Austrian Ambassadors in
                    this cause. The Department can offer no additional suggestions relative to this
                    most difficult situation other than that you continue to act as in the past.
                    Have any native-born American citizens or any naturalized American citizens
                    entitled to protection under American statutes received injuries during this
                    trouble?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
